  "comment": "Slug -> Vimm `system` map. Adopted from gamarr's registry (see plan §1.1, §14) and verified against live listing pages. Override at runtime with SOURCES_PATH or SOURCES_URL; a bad override falls back to this embedded copy rather than failing to boot.",
  "listFiltersComment": "The listing view is FILTERED BY DEFAULT and the defaults are narrow: only four regions are checked, only the newest version of each game, first disc only, and no prototypes/demos/unlicensed/bonus discs. Mirroring without these produces a USA-only catalogue — a PS2 sync returns 1,831 rows instead of ~11,800, and a Japan-focused collection would find almost nothing. The filter form is method=GET (action=filters), so every option is a query parameter. countries[] enumerates every region Vimm offers.",
